Rule 118 (The dtype must be smaller than complex type if numbers of shapes exceed one)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) + ndim(v_2) > 1 then dtype_(v_1) < 10 ∧ dtype_(v_2) < 10
